
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Aura Farming Secondary School</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f4fff4;
}

header {
  background: #004d26;
  color: gold;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
}

.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(#003d20, #087b40);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 15px;
}

.hero img {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 850px;
  border-radius: 15px;
}

h1 { color: gold; }

nav {
  background: #d4af37;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}

nav a {
  color: #003d20;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 10px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

footer {
  background: #004d26;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>AURA FARMING SECONDARY SCHOOL</h1>
<p>Learn • Grow • Succeed</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About Us</a>
<a href="#academics">Academics</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
<h1>WELCOME TO AURA FARMING SCHOOL</h1>

<p>Growing Knowledge, Building A Greener Future.</p>

<img src="aura-anime.png"
alt="Aura Farming School Anime Ambassador">

<h2>Knowledge • Agriculture • Excellence</h2>
</section>

<section id="about" style="text-align:center;padding:30px">
<h2>About Our School</h2>
<p>We combine academic excellence with agricultural innovation.</p>
</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Aura Farming Secondary School</p>
<p>Learn • Grow • Succeed</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>

